  "ppa_note": "A hub-settled solar PPA pays the generator the hub price; the plant earns the node. The solar-weighted basis is what that leaves the generator per MWh it produces (+ = node above hub). A geo-proxy bus reads a neighbour's basis: see location.tier_note.",
